{"id":"n66027-3-5","stage":1,"title":"뜨겁다 · 脸红","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66027-3-5-1","ko":"그런 실수를 하다니, 얼굴이 뜨거워서 고개를 둘 수가 없어.","zh":"竟然犯了那样的错误，羞得我都抬不起头来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그런","meaning":"那种，那样","explanation":"그런：那种，那样。","readings":[{"term":"그런","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60341","senseId":"1","lemma":"그런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그런","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3"}},{"text":"실수를","meaning":"失手，失误","explanation":"실수：失手，失误；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"실수","audio":"/audio/546e211475887e7443f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64947","senseId":"1","lemma":"실수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"실수를","audio":"/audio/19e1517b3067726f9af8.mp3"}},{"text":"하다니,","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；다니：对得知的内容表示惊讶、感叹，并连接后文。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하다니","audio":"/audio/91b283273ab687101f01.mp3"}},{"text":"얼굴이","meaning":"脸色","explanation":"얼굴：脸色；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"얼굴","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17183","senseId":"3","lemma":"얼굴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼굴이","audio":"/audio/81669bb10178aa2a65c6.mp3"}},{"text":"뜨거워서","meaning":"脸红， 脸发烫","explanation":"뜨겁다：脸红， 脸发烫；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"뜨겁다","audio":"/audio/e13d571ed55588aea4ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66027","senseId":"3","lemma":"뜨겁다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뜨거워서","audio":"/audio/1eaaf0f3f86a58953986.mp3"}},{"text":"고개를","meaning":"头，脑袋","explanation":"고개：头，脑袋；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"고개","audio":"/audio/44adfe36e1f5e4fe0260.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62501","senseId":"1","lemma":"고개","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고개를","audio":"/audio/69819e4ad9039edb44e0.mp3"}},{"text":"둘","meaning":"放、放置（本句形容羞得无地自容）","explanation":"두다：放、放置（本句形容羞得无地自容）；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"두다","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67470","senseId":"1","lemma":"두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"둘","audio":"/audio/ca76b1284fc2088d64d7.mp3"}},{"text":"수가","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수가","audio":"/audio/6780a417c9a853af476b.mp3"}},{"text":"없어.","meaning":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","explanation":"없다：不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없어","audio":"/audio/d3275bf98baed4550c12.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d14f5bfb24390ed9","term":"그런","zh":"那种，那样","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3","entryId":"60341","definition":"状态、模样、性质等那个样子的。","pronunciation":["그런"]},{"id":"546e211475887e74","term":"실수","zh":"失手，失误","audio":"/audio/546e211475887e7443f1.mp3","entryId":"64947","definition":"因不了解或不小心而犯的错误。","pronunciation":["실쑤"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"886ae927b512e2e4","term":"얼굴","zh":"脸色","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3","entryId":"17183","definition":"某种心理状态表露于外的表情。","pronunciation":["얼굴"]},{"id":"e13d571ed55588ae","term":"뜨겁다","zh":"脸红， 脸发烫","audio":"/audio/e13d571ed55588aea4ab.mp3","entryId":"66027","definition":"因为羞愧或害羞，觉得脸发热。","pronunciation":["뜨겁따"]},{"id":"44adfe36e1f5e4fe","term":"고개","zh":"头，脑袋","audio":"/audio/44adfe36e1f5e4fe0260.mp3","entryId":"62501","definition":"包括脖子在内的头部。","pronunciation":["고개"]},{"id":"531b2c3977c491e8","term":"두다","zh":"放、放置（本句形容羞得无地自容）","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3","entryId":"67470","definition":"放、放置（本句形容羞得无地自容）","pronunciation":["두다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/af8cb07f257f70069095.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66027-3-5-2","ko":"괜찮아. 누구나 다 실수는 하잖아.","zh":"没关系，谁都会犯错嘛。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"괜찮아.","meaning":"没关系，无所谓，可以","explanation":"괜찮다：没关系，无所谓，可以；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"괜찮다","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60097","senseId":"3","lemma":"괜찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"괜찮아","audio":"/audio/87dea6f32ecb5a9bbac8.mp3"}},{"text":"누구나","meaning":"谁都，无论是谁","explanation":"누구：谁都，无论是谁；나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"2","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누구나","audio":"/audio/578816a004f3d0c389b7.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"실수는","meaning":"失手，失误","explanation":"실수：失手，失误；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"실수","audio":"/audio/546e211475887e7443f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64947","senseId":"1","lemma":"실수",